        "title": " SharpLink buys another $54M in ETH, now holds $1.65B worth of Ether ",
        "text": "\n                \n                    <p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjUtMDcvMDE5N2U1OGQtMmM3Yy03MmQwLThjZTEtMzAyMDhjZmIxZDNj.jpg\" alt=\"SharpLink buys another $54M in ETH, now holds $1.65B worth of Ether\"></p><p>SharpLink spent $108.57 million in USDC over 48 hours to acquire 30,755 ETH, raising its total Ether holdings to 480,031 ETH worth $1.65 billion.</p>\n                                ",
